{#
| Variable      | Type    | Description                                                        |
|---------------|---------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
| video_url     | string  | MP4 the merchant uploads (silent, looping, 1440x620-ish)            |
| poster        | ?object | Still shown before the video decodes, and on data-saver connections |
| eyebrow       | ?string | Small label above the headline                                      |
| title         | ?string | Headline                                                            |
| description   | ?string | Supporting line                                                     |
| cta_text      | ?string | Primary button label                                                |
| url           | ?string | Primary button link                                                 |
| overlay       | Bool    | Darkening scrim behind the copy                                     |
| position      | Int     | Sorting number start from zero                                      |

The poster carries the first paint, so the section never renders empty while the video
loads, and a visitor on `prefers-reduced-motion` or a saver connection simply keeps it.
#}
<section component-id="{{ componentId }}" data-testid="store-home-hero-video"
         class="s-block s-block--hero-video tz-hero">
    <div class="tz-hero__media">
        {% if poster.url %}
            <img class="tz-hero__poster" src="{{ poster.url }}" alt="{{ title|default('') }}"
                 fetchpriority="high" width="1440" height="620">
        {% endif %}

        {% if video_url %}
            <video class="tz-hero__video" playsinline muted loop autoplay preload="metadata"
                   {% if poster.url %}poster="{{ poster.url }}"{% endif %}
                   aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
                <source src="{{ video_url }}" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        {% endif %}

        {% if overlay %}<div class="tz-hero__scrim"></div>{% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="container tz-hero__body">
        {% if eyebrow %}<p class="tz-hero__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if title %}<h2 class="tz-hero__title">{{ title }}</h2>{% endif %}
        {% if description %}<p class="tz-hero__desc">{{ description }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if cta_text and url %}
            <a href="{{ url }}" class="btn btn--outline tz-hero__cta">{{ cta_text }}</a>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>
